; a few small sacks stored as one small-sack with the wording in its note (no number is printed); one large sack. NOT stored, no catalog row: comb and/or brush (suggested slug hair-comb), loincloth or shorts (suggested slug loincloth), partial body armor with no helmet or shoes (the book names no make of armor). The other-possible-items list (wristwatch or pocket watch, hand-held communicator, language translator, backpack or satchel, candy, jelly and jams) is optional and is in GM Notes. || MONEY: the book prints no dice, only that a Big Foot adventurer will rarely have more than 1-2 thousand credits; no starting_money is stored and the race''s is none. || Cybernetics and the city breaking point (26 hours +1 hour per M.E. point, doubled in a quiet place; printed with the numeral 26) are restriction and side-effect text."
